# Optional semantic embeddings
*.pkl
# The CV embedding cache, both formats. This is derived from my_cv.pdf, so it
# carries the same personal data and must never be committed. The .pkl line stays
# because an operator upgrading from before the JSON switch still has one, and it
# would otherwise show up as a new untracked file.
cv_embeddings.json
cv_embeddings.pkl

